ics are recommended\n📔 The game was inspired by @lost_archive5 on social medias and Kiosk.\n❗ Better experienced with friends!\n\n❓ Could you survive all the nights, or be shamefully fired?","path":"/game/97267505570231-qol-update-road-side-shawarma-horror","slug":"97267505570231-qol-update-road-side-shawarma-horror","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/347f3d016ca0ff717c2684c7c930292792c5d2ebd9fec09ab65f66b53020b2a4.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-d8432f96fd4b999038bca2075daebe67/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":45,"visitor":184962970,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-11-25T20:47:22.631Z","creator":{"name":"nv1sh works","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":18935268719,"name":"[🎄🎁] Level Below","desc":"Inspired by the Netflix movie \"The Platform\". \n\nJoin the Group for an exclusive Title!\nhttps://www.roblox.com/communities/6751440/Supafly-Interactive#!/about\n\n🎯 Updates (Sep 14th) ❤️‍🔥🔥:\n- added permanent quests\n- added pink flame (Flamenco)\n- added quest to obtain pink flame (Flamenco)\n\n🤝 Join forces with other players, or go at it alone as you navigate deadly challenges!\n⚔️ Fight to stay alive and outmaneuver your opponents.\n🏆 Only the strongest will emerge victorious in the battle ahead.\n\nAre you up for the challenge?\n\n🎮 Fully compatible with mobile, keyboard & mouse, console, and VR. 🥽\n\nCredits:\n@Vyklar - Project manager and builder\n@RealmOfTheDeceased - Lead developer & scripted","path":"/game/18935268719-level-below","slug":"18935268719-level-below","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/9ea62ef6a1ac1d59e89a4a24ff6d22a9e83a74cbbe156c14adf1e2b6d2c0042a.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-66bec09ffc6585800c1e460f59cdbc18/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":45,"visitor":92942305,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-01-04T03:42:34.568Z","creator":{"name":"Supafly Interactive","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,